# Source: https://github.com/wellmanifest/lifecycle
# Revision: 1ea2a90bd5b90a768ad2b36a9c1c330523bc80b4
# Compatibility projection; domain conformance remains authoritative.

LIFECYCLE product-release VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Product registration, release, restriction, deprecation and sunset"
STATE DRAFT INITIAL
STATES [PREVIEW, GENERALLY_AVAILABLE, RESTRICTED, DEPRECATED, WITHDRAWN]
STATE SUNSET TERMINAL
EVENTS [REGISTER, RELEASE, RESTRICT, DEPRECATE, WITHDRAW, SUNSET]
EVIDENCES [REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE, RELEASE_EVIDENCE, RESTRICTION_DECISION, DEPRECATION_DECISION, WITHDRAWAL_DECISION, SUNSET_EVIDENCE]
TRANSITION DRAFT -> PREVIEW ON REGISTER REQUIRES REGISTRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION [DRAFT, PREVIEW] -> GENERALLY_AVAILABLE ON RELEASE REQUIRES RELEASE_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION GENERALLY_AVAILABLE -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES RESTRICTION_DECISION
TRANSITION [GENERALLY_AVAILABLE, RESTRICTED] -> DEPRECATED ON DEPRECATE REQUIRES DEPRECATION_DECISION
TRANSITION [GENERALLY_AVAILABLE, RESTRICTED, DEPRECATED] -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION [WITHDRAWN, DEPRECATED] -> SUNSET ON SUNSET REQUIRES SUNSET_EVIDENCE
END
